TITLE Albite kinetics + fixed P H2S(g), check Ba at steps 10 and 70
SOLUTION 1
    temp 200
    pH 2 charge
    pe 4
    units mmol/kgw
    Fe(3) 4
    Fe(2) 4
    -water 1

GAS_PHASE 1
    -fixed_pressure
    -pressure 5
    -volume 1
    H2S(g) 5

KINETICS 1
    Albite
        -m0 1
        -m  1
        -parms 1.0 10
        -tol 1e-12
    -steps 10 60 290 640

SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file sel.txt
    -reset false
    -high_precision true
    -time true
    -totals Ba

END